editor.crop_tip:
{size}
Drag the corners and edges of the frame; inside the frame: move it.
Enter or “Crop”: crop. Esc or “Cancel”: cancel. Double-click inside the frame: crop.

editor.mode_hint_tip:
Drag the mouse over the words you need, like a highlighter: the selection opens in a window
for copying and is placed on the clipboard right away. Ctrl + stroke: add another piece. Double-click:
one word. Ctrl+A: all text, Ctrl+C: copy the selection, Esc: leave this mode.

editor.selected_tip:
{size}
Selected: {name}
The color, thickness and text color buttons change only this object; the default settings for new objects stay the same.
Right-click: actions menu. Delete: remove. Ctrl+D: duplicate. Esc or a click on empty space: deselect.
